N00B_DIAG(UNRESOLVED_NAME, "N00B-N0001", ERROR,
    "a name is used that is not declared in any visible scope",
    "Every name must be declared before it is used: as a local, a parameter,\n"
    "a declaration in this module, or a name brought in from another module.\n"
    "Check the spelling, or import the module that declares it:\n"
    "    import helper\n"
    "    let x = helper.compute(1)")
N00B_DIAG(UNKNOWN_TYPE, "N00B-N0002", ERROR,
    "a type name does not refer to any visible type",
    "Type annotations must name a built-in type, a type declared in this\n"
    "module, or a type exported by an imported module. Check the spelling,\n"
    "or import the module that declares the type:\n"
    "    let x: string = \"a\"")
N00B_DIAG(MODULE_MEMBER_MISSING, "N00B-N0003", ERROR,
    "a module does not declare the member that is used",
    "`module.name` looks up `name` among the declarations of `module`.\n"
    "The module has no declaration with that name. Check the spelling, or\n"
    "add the declaration to the module.")
N00B_DIAG(MODULE_MEMBER_PRIVATE, "N00B-N0004", ERROR,
    "a module member is used from a module that cannot see it",
    "A declaration marked `private` is visible only inside its own module,\n"
    "and a package shows other packages only what its manifest exports.\n"
    "Remove `private` from the declaration, export it from the package\n"
    "manifest, or use a visible declaration instead.")
N00B_DIAG(FIELD_MISSING, "N00B-N0005", ERROR,
    "a field is read from a record or object type that does not declare it",
    "`value.name` reads the field `name`, which the value's record or object\n"
    "type must declare:\n"
    "    record Point {\n"
    "        x: int\n"
    "    }\n"
    "    require p.x == 1\n"
    "Check the spelling against the type's fields.")
N00B_DIAG(FIELD_NOT_VISIBLE, "N00B-N0006", ERROR,
    "a private field or variant arm is used outside its module",
    "A `private` field is visible only inside the module that declares its\n"
    "type. Use a function of that module to read or change it, or remove\n"
    "`private` from the field.")
N00B_DIAG(VARIANT_CASE_NOT_ARM, "N00B-N0007", ERROR,
    "a `case` in a switch over a variant names something that is not an arm",
    "When a switch inspects a variant value, each `case` must name one of\n"
    "the variant's arms. Check the spelling against the arms the variant\n"
    "declares.")
N00B_DIAG(RESERVED_NAME, "N00B-N0008", ERROR,
    "a declaration uses a name reserved for the language",
    "Names that start with two underscores belong to the language: hooks\n"
    "such as `__init`, `__finalize` or `__cmp`, and built-in members such as\n"
    "`__value`. Declare a language hook with its exact name, or choose a\n"
    "name that does not start with `__`.")
N00B_DIAG(VALUE_USED_AS_TYPE, "N00B-N0009", ERROR,
    "a value is used where a type is required",
    "Type arguments and annotations must name types. A variable, constant\n"
    "or function cannot stand in for a type:\n"
    "    var items: List[int] = new[List[int]]()")
N00B_DIAG(OWN_PACKAGE_NAMESPACE, "N00B-N0010", ERROR,
    "a package refers to itself by its external namespace",
    "Code inside a package refers to its own modules by their internal\n"
    "module names. The external namespace is only for other packages.")
N00B_DIAG(TYPE_NAME_SHADOWED, "N00B-N0011", ERROR,
    "a declaration reuses the name of a visible type",
    "Type names cannot be shadowed, because a value with the name of a type\n"
    "would make annotations ambiguous. Choose another name.")
N00B_DIAG(LOCAL_HIDES_IMPORT, "N00B-N0012", ERROR,
    "a local declaration hides an imported declaration this use needs",
    "A local declaration takes precedence over a brought-in or prelude name,\n"
    "but here the local one cannot be used the way the code uses the name.\n"
    "Rename the local declaration, or use the imported one by its qualified\n"
    "path, such as `helper.name`.")
N00B_DIAG(AMBIGUOUS_NAME, "N00B-N0013", ERROR,
    "a name refers to declarations from more than one module",
    "Two or more modules in scope declare this name and nothing decides\n"
    "between them. Refer to the one you mean by its qualified path, or bring\n"
    "in only one of them.")
N00B_DIAG(BRING_CONFLICT, "N00B-N0014", ERROR,
    "a name brought in with `bring` conflicts with another name",
    "Each brought-in name must be unique in the module. Rename one of them:\n"
    "    bring circle as round_circle from shapes")
N00B_DIAG(BRING_MISSING, "N00B-N0015", ERROR,
    "a `bring` names something the module does not make visible",
    "`bring name from module` copies a visible declaration of `module` into\n"
    "this module's scope, and the module has no visible declaration with\n"
    "that name. To bring everything, write `bring all from module`.")
N00B_DIAG(MODULE_NAME_NOT_IMPORTED, "N00B-N0016", ERROR,
    "a module is referred to by a name that is not available here",
    "A module imported with `as` is referred to only by its new name, and a\n"
    "module whose names are only brought in with `bring` has no name of its\n"
    "own here. Use the alias, or add `import module`.")
N00B_DIAG(DUPLICATE_DEFINITION, "N00B-N0017", ERROR,
    "the same declaration is defined more than once",
    "A function with a given name and parameter types can be defined only\n"
    "once in a module. Remove one definition, rename it, or change its\n"
    "parameter types so it becomes a distinct overload.")
N00B_DIAG(OVERLAPPING_IMPORT, "N00B-N0018", WARNING,
    "a local function overlaps an imported function of the same name",
    "When both functions accept a call, the call binds to the local one.\n"
    "Rename the local function if the imported one was meant, or call the\n"
    "imported one by its qualified path.")
N00B_DIAG(UNUSED_FUNCTION, "N00B-N0019", WARNING,
    "a function that no other module can call is never called",
    "A private function, or a function nested in another function, that is\n"
    "never called is dead code. Call it, remove `private` so other modules\n"
    "can use it, or delete it. Exported functions and `main` and `start`\n"
    "are never reported.")
N00B_DIAG(FIELD_NEVER_SET, "N00B-N0020", WARNING,
    "a private field is never given a value",
    "No code ever writes this field, so it always holds its default value.\n"
    "Set it where the value is built, or remove it.")
N00B_DIAG(FIELD_NEVER_READ, "N00B-N0021", WARNING,
    "a private field is written but never read",
    "Values are stored in this field but nothing reads them. Read the field\n"
    "where it is needed, or remove it.")
N00B_DIAG(CALL_TOO_MANY_ARGUMENTS, "N00B-T0001", ERROR,
    "a call passes more arguments than the function has parameters",
    "Each positional argument fills the next parameter of the function, and\n"
    "this call passes more arguments than there are parameters. Remove the\n"
    "extra arguments, or call a function that takes them.")
N00B_DIAG(CALL_MISSING_ARGUMENT, "N00B-T0002", ERROR,
    "a call does not supply a required parameter",
    "Every parameter without a default value needs an argument, by position\n"
    "or by name:\n"
    "    area(2, 3)\n"
    "    area(width = 2, height = 3)")
N00B_DIAG(CALL_UNKNOWN_NAMED_ARGUMENT, "N00B-T0003", ERROR,
    "a named argument does not match any parameter of the function",
    "`name = value` in a call supplies the parameter called `name`, and the\n"
    "function has no parameter with that name. Check the spelling against\n"
    "the function's declaration.")
N00B_DIAG(CALL_ARGUMENT_REPEATED, "N00B-T0004", ERROR,
    "a call supplies the same parameter twice",
    "A parameter receives exactly one argument. Here it is supplied by\n"
    "position or by name and then again by name. Remove one of them.")
N00B_DIAG(CALL_ARGUMENT_TYPE, "N00B-T0005", ERROR,
    "an argument's type does not match its parameter's type",
    "Each argument must have, or convert to, the type its parameter\n"
    "declares. Convert the value before the call, or pass another value:\n"
    "    func twice(n: int) -> int\n"
    "    require twice(4) == 8")
N00B_DIAG(METHOD_RECEIVER_TYPE, "N00B-T0006", ERROR,
    "a method is called on a value of the wrong type",
    "The value before the `.` becomes the method's first parameter, so it\n"
    "must have, or convert to, that parameter's type.")
N00B_DIAG(CALL_RESULT_TYPE, "N00B-T0007", ERROR,
    "a function's result is used as a different type",
    "A call produces a value of the function's declared result type, and the\n"
    "surrounding code expects another type. Convert the result, or call a\n"
    "function that returns the expected type.")
N00B_DIAG(TRAIT_SIGNATURE_MISMATCH, "N00B-T0008", ERROR,
    "a trait implementation's signature does not fit a call",
    "The implementation chosen for this call has a signature that does not\n"
    "fit the argument and result types at the call. Make the implementation\n"
    "match the trait's declared signature.")
N00B_DIAG(OVERLOAD_NEEDS_TYPE, "N00B-T0010", ERROR,
    "an overloaded function is called with an argument of unknown type",
    "Choosing between overloads needs the argument types. Annotate the\n"
    "argument or the variable it comes from:\n"
    "    let n: i64 = 0")
N00B_DIAG(OVERLOAD_NO_MATCH, "N00B-T0011", ERROR,
    "no overload of a function accepts the arguments of a call",
    "Each overload was checked against the call's argument types and none\n"
    "accepted them. Compare the argument types with the candidate signatures\n"
    "listed with the error.")
N00B_DIAG(OVERLOAD_AMBIGUOUS, "N00B-T0012", ERROR,
    "more than one overload accepts a call equally well",
    "Two or more overloads accept the argument types and none is more\n"
    "specific. Annotate an argument with the exact type of the overload you\n"
    "mean.")
N00B_DIAG(OVERLOAD_FROM_SEVERAL_MODULES, "N00B-T0013", ERROR,
    "functions from different modules all accept a call",
    "The called name refers to functions from more than one module, and\n"
    "more than one of them accepts the arguments. Call the one you mean by\n"
    "its qualified path.")
N00B_DIAG(OVERLOAD_PREFERS_EXACT, "N00B-T0014", WARNING,
    "an exact overload is chosen over one that needs a conversion",
    "An overload that accepts the arguments without conversion wins over one\n"
    "that would convert them. Annotate the argument if the converting\n"
    "overload was meant.")
N00B_DIAG(CONSUME_BORROWED_PARAMETER, "N00B-T0015", ERROR,
    "a borrowed parameter is passed to a `consume` parameter",
    "A `consume` parameter takes ownership of its argument. An `in` or\n"
    "`view` parameter only borrows its value, so it cannot pass ownership\n"
    "on. Pass a copy, or declare the parameter `consume`.")
N00B_DIAG(VIEW_VALUE_TO_NON_VIEW, "N00B-T0016", ERROR,
    "a value reached through a `view` parameter is passed where it could be changed",
    "Everything reachable from a `view` parameter is read-only, so it can\n"
    "only be passed on to other `view` parameters. Declare the callee's\n"
    "parameter `view`, or declare this parameter `modify`.")
N00B_DIAG(METHOD_NOT_FOUND, "N00B-T0017", ERROR,
    "a method is called on a type that has no method of that name",
    "`value.name(...)` calls a method declared by a trait that the value's\n"
    "type implements, and no such trait declares this method. Check the\n"
    "spelling, or implement a trait that declares it. Plain functions are\n"
    "called as `name(value)`.")
N00B_DIAG(TRAIT_NOT_IMPLEMENTED, "N00B-T0018", ERROR,
    "an operation needs a trait that the value's type does not implement",
    "Operators, method calls and generic functions require their operand\n"
    "types to implement particular traits. Implement the trait for the type,\n"
    "or use a value of a type that implements it.")
N00B_DIAG(TRAIT_IMPLEMENTATION_AMBIGUOUS, "N00B-T0019", ERROR,
    "more than one trait implementation fits a value equally well",
    "Two or more implementations apply to the value's type and none is more\n"
    "specific. Annotate the value with a more specific type, or remove one\n"
    "of the implementations.")
N00B_DIAG(CONSTRUCTOR_TRAIT_REQUIRED, "N00B-T0022", ERROR,
    "a construction's argument lacks a trait that `__init` requires",
    "The `__init` that would build this value constrains its argument to a\n"
    "trait, and the argument's type does not implement that trait.")
N00B_DIAG(CONSTRUCTOR_MISSING, "N00B-T0023", ERROR,
    "a type is constructed with arguments but has no visible `__init`",
    "`new[T](...)` with arguments calls a visible `__init` of `T`. Declare\n"
    "one, or build the value from its fields.")
N00B_DIAG(CONSTRUCTOR_NO_MATCH, "N00B-T0024", ERROR,
    "no `__init` of a type accepts the arguments of a construction",
    "Each visible `__init` of the type was checked against the arguments and\n"
    "none accepted them. Compare the arguments with the `__init` signatures.")
N00B_DIAG(CONSTRUCTOR_AMBIGUOUS, "N00B-T0025", ERROR,
    "more than one `__init` accepts a construction equally well",
    "Two or more `__init` functions fit the arguments and none is more\n"
    "specific. Annotate the arguments with exact types, or remove one.")
N00B_DIAG(OPERATOR_OPERAND_TYPES, "N00B-T0026", ERROR,
    "an operator's operands do not fit the implementation it resolves to",
    "Both operands must fit the trait method that implements the operator\n"
    "for the left operand's type. Convert one operand so both sides have\n"
    "matching types.")
N00B_DIAG(INDEX_RESULT_TYPE, "N00B-T0027", ERROR,
    "an indexing expression is used as a type its implementation does not produce",
    "`value[i]` produces the result type of the container's index\n"
    "implementation, and the surrounding code expects another type.")
N00B_DIAG(CALLBACK_AMBIGUOUS, "N00B-T0029", ERROR,
    "more than one callback setup fits a handler type",
    "Two or more callback setup implementations fit the handler type equally\n"
    "well. Annotate the handler with a more specific type.")
N00B_DIAG(CALLBACK_PRIVATE, "N00B-T0030", ERROR,
    "the callback setup implementation for a handler is private",
    "The implementation that fits this handler is private to its module, so\n"
    "it cannot be used here. Remove `private` from it.")
N00B_DIAG(CALLBACK_MISSING, "N00B-T0031", ERROR,
    "no callback setup implementation fits a handler type",
    "No visible callback setup implementation accepts this handler's type.\n"
    "Change the handler's signature, or provide an implementation.")
N00B_DIAG(GENERIC_METHOD_UNDECLARED, "N00B-T0032", ERROR,
    "a method is called on a generic value but no trait declares it",
    "A value whose type is a type parameter such as `'T` can only use\n"
    "methods that a trait declares, so that every possible `'T` is checked\n"
    "the same way. Declare the method in a trait.")
N00B_DIAG(OPERATOR_NOT_IMPLEMENTED, "N00B-T0033", ERROR,
    "an operator is used on a type that does not implement it",
    "Operators such as `+`, `==` and `[]` are implemented by traits, and the\n"
    "operand's type does not implement the trait for this operator.\n"
    "Implement it, or convert the operand to a type that does.")
N00B_DIAG(GENERIC_TRAIT_AMBIGUOUS, "N00B-T0034", ERROR,
    "a generic call finds two equally good implementations for its argument",
    "The generic function uses a trait method on its argument, and for the\n"
    "argument type used here more than one implementation fits equally well.\n"
    "Remove or specialize one of them.")
N00B_DIAG(GENERIC_TRAIT_MISSING, "N00B-T0035", ERROR,
    "a generic function is called with a type that lacks a trait it uses",
    "The generic function uses a trait method on its argument, and the\n"
    "argument type used here does not implement that trait. Implement the\n"
    "trait for the type, or pass a value of a type that implements it.")
N00B_DIAG(INVALID_TYPE_NAME, "N00B-T0036", ERROR,
    "a type name is not a valid identifier",
    "Type names must be identifiers in Unicode normal form C. Rename the\n"
    "type.")
N00B_DIAG(GENERIC_RETURN_TYPE, "N00B-T0037", ERROR,
    "a generic function's returned values do not fit its result type for a call",
    "For the argument types of this call, the values the generic function\n"
    "returns do not fit its declared result type.")
N00B_DIAG(FAILURE_TYPES_INCOMPATIBLE, "N00B-T0038", ERROR,
    "the failures a generic call can raise do not combine into one type",
    "The trait implementations used by this generic call fail with types\n"
    "that cannot be combined. Make their failure types agree.")
N00B_DIAG(TYPE_REFERENCE_CONFLICT, "N00B-T0039", ERROR,
    "a type name is used where a different type is required",
    "The type a name refers to does not fit the way the surrounding code\n"
    "uses it. Check that the annotation names the intended type.")
N00B_DIAG(CYCLIC_ALIAS, "N00B-T0040", ERROR,
    "a type alias is defined in terms of itself",
    "A transparent alias is another name for its target, so an alias whose\n"
    "target leads back to the alias names nothing. Break the cycle with a\n"
    "record, an object or a nominal alias.")
N00B_DIAG(FIELD_TYPE_MISMATCH, "N00B-T0041", ERROR,
    "a field's value is used as a type the field does not have",
    "Reading `value.field` produces the field's declared type, and the\n"
    "surrounding code expects another type.")
N00B_DIAG(REFERENT_NEEDS_REFERENCE, "N00B-T0042", ERROR,
    "`__value` is read from a value that is not a reference",
    "`r.__value` reads what a `Ref` or `Foreign` pointer refers to. Other\n"
    "values have no referent; use the value directly.")
N00B_DIAG(MEMBER_ON_UNKNOWN_TYPE, "N00B-T0043", ERROR,
    "a member is read from a value whose type is not known",
    "Reading `value.name` needs the value's type. Annotate the variable or\n"
    "parameter the value comes from:\n"
    "    func f(p: Point) -> int")
N00B_DIAG(MEMBER_ON_NON_RECORD, "N00B-T0044", ERROR,
    "a field is read from a value whose type has no fields",
    "Only record and object values have fields. Check that the value has\n"
    "the type you expect.")
N00B_DIAG(IMPORTED_VALUE_TYPE, "N00B-T0045", ERROR,
    "an imported value is used as a type it does not have",
    "The imported declaration's type does not fit the way it is used here.\n"
    "Convert it, or use a different declaration.")
N00B_DIAG(TYPE_MISMATCH, "N00B-T0046", ERROR,
    "an expression's type does not match the type its context requires",
    "Each expression has one type, and every use of it must agree with that\n"
    "type. Convert the value, or change the annotation that disagrees.")
N00B_DIAG(NOT_CALLABLE, "N00B-T0047", ERROR,
    "a value that is not a function is called",
    "Only functions can be called with `(...)`. Check that the name refers\n"
    "to the function you meant and is not hidden by a variable.")
N00B_DIAG(RECURSIVE_TYPE, "N00B-T0048", ERROR,
    "a value would need a type that contains itself",
    "An expression's type cannot contain itself, as in a list that would\n"
    "have to hold itself. This usually means one value is used both as a\n"
    "container and as its own element.")
N00B_DIAG(TYPE_REQUIREMENT, "N00B-T0049", ERROR,
    "a value's type is not of the kind an operation requires",
    "Some operations accept only certain kinds of types, such as integers\n"
    "for bitwise operators. Convert the value to an accepted type.")